{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "40d13f7dad7ee5a5edd13aeac72ae7d96c7525adcb05514f3be0e47724834dbe", "ja": "Film 01　再集結", "zh": "Film 01　再集结", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e02d8a521d2c57f5d5fb6b858f80b62c3931889d8ca2f6054af5f4f5a8be5bbb", "ja": "新しいライブハウスのこけら落とし公演に\n出演が決まった『≡君彩≡』。久々のバンド\n活動に喜ぶ3人だったが、それぞれの仕事の\n都合で以前よりも合同練習の時間が取れず、\n可奈は一抹の不安を覚えるのだった。", "zh": "决定出演新Livehouse揭幕演出的\n“≡君彩≡”。3人虽然为久违的乐队活动\n感到高兴，但由于各自的工作安排，\n无法像以前那样抽出时间一起合练，\n可奈不禁感到了一丝不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "26ecd7a89cc427711229b106f9f403f956d25a2fcd90af7837f42de2d4582c25", "ja": "（今日は『≡君彩≡』、久々の集結だ。\nもうみんな集まってるかな……）", "zh": "（今天是『≡君彩≡』久违的重聚。大家应该已经到了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "113390cf76aef4fbf8a6b56bde63a3ea38ca7d00f96c935269e4ba9d36e9a7c6", "ja": "それじゃ、『≡君彩≡』の再集結を祝って～……\nカンパーイ！", "zh": "那么，就为『≡君彩≡』再次集结——干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1002_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "0ccfe9046585a99c22723d6974301258faec7d28b8615ce6fae25ac3d7c4b223", "ja": "カンパーイ♪　……って、{$P$}！\nゴメン、先に始めちゃってた。", "zh": "干杯♪……等等，{$P$}！\n抱歉，已经先开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "deac11e7e2944815e801cf79404ad254bd567e6def82bb6adc39643d056ac932", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。\nというか、早速盛り上がってるな！", "zh": "没事，不要紧的。\n话说回来，你们已经这么热闹啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "3f9796b66a445ded916ff51e25b67c3d588ca5a3cfa5e8183ed428a2a1adad56", "ja": "当然ですよ、{$P$}さん！\nだって、『≡君彩≡』の再集結ですよーーーっ！？", "zh": "那是当然啦，{$P$}先生！\n毕竟可是“≡君彩≡”的再次集结啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "da09e52e7c78128e05aa76cd56e2414e07c5fb1dc503241d9f6dd268694ea986", "ja": "恵美ちゃん、可奈ちゃん、そしてありさの、\nあの熱い青春の日々が再び……！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "惠美、可奈，还有亚利纱的，\n那段热血青春岁月又要重现了……！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "65caf3c5e6b46dc11e9aa0109bd93b1001b3276e6bda006559b04340182363c1", "ja": "私も、またバンドやりたいな～って思ってました！\nギターの可奈～♪　久々かな～♪　えへっ。", "zh": "我也一直想着，好想再组一次乐队啊～吉他手可奈～♪ 好久没弹了呢～♪ 嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "1fb3401bc0a95f824a41edbecd314925a377bf2cfd5017587779ccd0e583beb2", "ja": "しかも、あの『庭園』の跡地にできたライブハウス\nなんでしょ？　なんか、運命感じちゃうよね～。", "zh": "而且，还是在那个『庭园』旧址上建成的Live House，对吧？总觉得有种命运般的感觉呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "ffc02304531aab695663dbbc17e407a58b32ee14c5a16bdbb08af72ad24be6a1", "ja": "『庭園』はありさたちにとって、思い出が\nギューッと詰まったライブハウスですからね！", "zh": "因为对亚利沙她们来说，『庭园』可是充满了满满回忆的Live House呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "b07bea5919ac263b677d43dd9d97cf99898e2bd314cae7a5188e59ec46d9cc9d", "ja": "初ライブに、MV撮影。\nその後の『庭園』ラストライブまで……。", "zh": "从第一次演出、拍摄MV，\n到后来在『庭园』举办的最后一场演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "78000cd515590cca160fe1d454e92e56fd0665d1d5bc7d2ecdf19981406e0247", "ja": "楽屋の壁に、みんなでサインを書きましたよね！\nちょっと懐かしいな～♪", "zh": "我们还一起在后台的墙上签名了呢！\n真让人有点怀念啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7daf3a77b8fcb152b8bdbbb4d55d5461f4f8632c3140daa6695c88d593c151a8", "ja": "今回声をかけてくれた新しいオーナーさんは、\n『庭園』でのみんなのライブを観てたそうなんだ。", "zh": "这次邀请我们的新老板，听说曾在『庭园』看过大家的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6c2053eda4969a4f9fce954562bd814508b143846a3b400d4b965bd61c10b352", "ja": "そこで聞いた皆の演奏が、ずっと心に残っていて……\nそれで、今回のこけら落としに声をかけてくれたとか。", "zh": "听到的大家的演奏一直留在心里……\n所以这次才邀请我们参加开幕演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "1c018af02f7e11dc0f0dad47e4a03d38cc8c18a94447a70364a8dccfb860635c", "ja": "ええっ、そうだったんですね！？\n私たちの演奏を、覚えててくれた人がいたなんて……！", "zh": "诶，原来是这样啊！？\n没想到竟然有人一直记得我们的演奏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3a11dcb921a17c8fec6ba266b37d4d45db442ceb34833f9099d7dc1fd6c0a01a", "ja": "うん、本当にすごい事だと思う。\n今回のステージも、期待してるって言ってたよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得真的很了不起。\n对方还说，很期待这次的舞台呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "984e6e837c985f3d0e466bb9b41880c246993d46e585ed5b0c237aff40c591fb", "ja": "そんな話聞いたら、ますますやる気でちゃうよね！\n久々のピアノが不安なんて言ってられないや。", "zh": "听你这么一说，就更有干劲了呢！\n可不能因为好久没弹钢琴而感到不安呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "8de5cbe1f9c484695a1542ccc00bb34a76e3d01fa1b6dff457d16708b61f48f0", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……！\n私もギターの感覚、早く思い出さなくちゃ！", "zh": "是、是啊……！我也得赶紧找回弹吉他的感觉才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "0f6a0cd783b3bc9a9bfaafa243b6b6dcf381837a46bb50e46d31bffdd3aa86b3", "ja": "ありさも、そこはちょっと不安ですケド……。\n前回も、超初心者スタートで乗り越えたわけですし！", "zh": "亚利沙对那方面也稍微有点不安……\n不过上次也是从零基础小白开始克服过来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "2ee937db11046659ffe371f011e7e3bf9c1fc702f638f4a02fb4dc54de126650", "ja": "だよね！\nとにかく、みんなで練習あるのみ！", "zh": "对吧！\n总之，大家一起练习就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "53e9b7ce70ec18575dcf33f891c8ee7cc446639ecbd4d04d2ae9c24f9d8b4d2c", "ja": "その事で、相談なんだけど……実はスケジュール的に、\n前ほど3人で練習する時間が取れそうになくて。", "zh": "关于这件事，我想和你们商量一下……其实从日程安排来看，恐怕没法像以前那样，抽出时间让3人一起练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5c10c83691713a2c3751b44c2f57cccd488edc4191ccc7bdff48d594407d4e61", "ja": "3人とも、近頃は仕事が増えてるだろ？\nもちろん、できる限りの調整はするけど……。", "zh": "你们3个人最近工作都增加了对吧？\n虽然我当然会尽量去调整……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "8f87438f330737e7bcd513aea298b9850b464c0b11abe2af3b9caff33096ae5d", "ja": "あー……そうだよね。この後のレッスンも、\nアタシは途中で抜ける予定だし……。", "zh": "啊……也是。接下来的课程，我也打算中途先离开……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "a94d28ae123a2aa3c2e15ec7198e1c0de397b1be23ad7af571ad41c2da5f92b7", "ja": "ううっ、ありさもです……。", "zh": "呜呜，亚利沙也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "1095acebc0c63ab33a36a8bb74840130dbb824eb024f20dac132d58b4608f318", "ja": "だから、どうしても個人レッスンがメインになる。\n大変だと思うけど、頑張れそうか？", "zh": "所以，无论如何都只能以个人训练为主。\n我知道这很辛苦，不过你能努力坚持下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "67c07973a12a245b4450248cc8aabec9ab4d8dd98b673baa8a3e47f1734f7e80", "ja": "でもでもっ、やるしかないですもんね。\n私、足を引っ張らないようにたくさん練習してきます！", "zh": "可是可是！也只能硬着头皮上了呢。\n我会多多练习，不给大家拖后腿的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "b8cfce3f7e60e7c587dd04504b1f82c543472e6e2698e7cd74d6a2b5e46eb833", "ja": "アタシも！　それに、合わせる時間は少ないかもだけど\n前よりアタシたちの絆は深まってるわけだし？", "zh": "我也会！而且，虽然可能没多少时间磨合，\n但我们之间的羁绊不是比以前更深了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "67474c76928d9b62984f6736302045ec447410d92ba6bb219ed646286643ccf5", "ja": "はいっ！\n『≡君彩≡』の絆の力を、見せつけますよぉ～！", "zh": "好的！\n就让你见识一下『≡君彩≡』羁绊的力量吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a3bfd69427915c6567c139aa9f6fe827bd7442aba709675eb282843476873d6a", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ！\nそれじゃ、久々に楽器の練習だな！", "zh": "啊，就是这个劲头！\n那么，久违地练习乐器吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1029_null", "source_sha256": "3a989dd767703900a51c1c1b5e896b45a9ddccfbb98f471d2c685862faad7df6", "ja": "レッスン後……", "zh": "练习后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "483ec9f6a4394013bb38181d18dc42d94e63690236e64b5b044ab8d7a66488d5", "ja": "はぁ～～……。\nやっとなんとか思い出してきた……。", "zh": "唉～～……  \n总算勉强想起来一些了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "9b7abe06d88dc7c18167ef9abc1642572d381207786998d2af44937686fba61c", "ja": "私も、ギターの大変さを思い出してきました……。\nううっ、指がからまる～、ぜんぶ空回る～……♪", "zh": "我也渐渐想起弹吉他的辛苦了……呜呜，手指都缠在一起了～，全都白忙活了～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "aa8c15ebf5d4da1640cdb4dbe16d5a6155e7cccf4e63759346b9d17de8ce05a6", "ja": "はい……久しぶりなせいでしょうか……。ありさも、\nなかなかリズムが取れず……難易度高……っ！", "zh": "是啊……是因为很久没练了吗……？我也一直找不准节奏……难度好高……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "b0032ef1ddea4432c038d8b1b678aeb73ce2c1ccae09b927efce6e54f4382781", "ja": "ま、まぁまぁ。今日は初日だしな。\nここから、またひとつずつ積み上げていこう！", "zh": "嘛，没事没事。今天毕竟是第一天嘛。\n从现在开始，再一步一步积累吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "d969cc6f1b6952e152fd5b60623855eb68bf4270c3157fd4cdbe3d44f766a991", "ja": "ゴメンね、みんな。アタシ、今日は全然ダメダメで……\n次までにちゃんとできるようになっておくから！", "zh": "对不起，大家。今天我真的糟透了……\n下次之前我一定会练好，做到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "9b59a679ef850e2bbf855ae629aa1660539f618bf5c76b035e21e1dcf0bb361c", "ja": "ありさも、リズム担当として……\n次こそ、しっかりサポートしてみせますっ！", "zh": "亚利沙也会作为节奏担当……\n下次一定好好为大家提供支援！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "3bc3557646f7fa9e678ab8a6ab22041c0c169214ff8e5cd55b9ae7d216e54c5b", "ja": "わ、私は、えっと……\nジュリアさんに弟子入りしてきますっ！", "zh": "我、我那个……要去拜茱莉亚先生为师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "70aaac82c37fb377abec1beb300138c6b96442f712b33a6e1ec0c3e5ab1b18f0", "ja": "うん。できるサポートはなんでもするから、\n遠慮せず言ってくれ。", "zh": "嗯。我能提供的支持都会尽力去做，所以别客气，尽管告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "95ab5b8a93ba8a3ab2705735fd4968c2a158f9fa4f2b4181360045c84a7af724", "ja": "それと……恵美と亜利沙は、\nそろそろ仕事の時間だな。", "zh": "还有……惠美和亚利沙也差不多该去工作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "070e653a42abfbc95d435fdea21dcaddf0a950dee40ed6aad92ed70c5bf9f67b", "ja": "あー、もうタイムアップかぁ。\nうう、なんだか不完全燃焼ってカンジ……。", "zh": "啊～，已经到时间啦。\n呜呜，总感觉有点意犹未尽呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "4de6365a42dec993731b20e218671e32ca42d9da9d5159d74888d82fe516dbce", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。私は、\nもうすこし練習していっても大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。我可以再练习一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "a738fe4cd9eb43b00019dad27b94f64fada2a458bbdfbda8f7730874f5f4bc9e", "ja": "ああ。この後もレッスン室は空いてるから\n好きに使っていいぞ。後片付けだけよろしくな。", "zh": "嗯。接下来练习室也空着，你尽管用吧。之后收拾一下就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "2d3ad5e9642380a5320cc0ac609295743782922d266a5823b6cb71ff1d479824", "ja": "わかりました！\n恵美さん、亜利沙さん、いってらっしゃい！", "zh": "好的！\n惠美小姐、亚利沙小姐，路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "c6158f1e01180e666a96ff8f5594c4f76c22a866205626c4e45a61209d75da1b", "ja": "か、可奈ちゃんの『いってらっしゃい』……！\nありがとうございます、何よりのご褒美です！", "zh": "可奈说的那句“路上小心”……！谢谢，这是最棒的奖励！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "509c5052d1e57b1dfdee8b069bc44511fbe16da72979e31d78dab44a3152ce71", "ja": "にゃはは。\nそれじゃ、いってくるね！", "zh": "呀哈哈。\n那我出发啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1045_se", "source_sha256": "eb4c048e033caf434564d9e67c9f30521449d9b8cd2310ccaf6b5f46b5e6cf96", "ja": "ガチャ、……バタン", "zh": "咔嗒，……砰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0425_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_01_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "dfe792d95c93dd618b2d4e7aececbe7a2384e5f46d97de67ec575626f4fe8efe", "ja": "はぁ……本当に大丈夫かな……。\nううん、でもやるしかないよね！　がんばるぞ～！", "zh": "哈啊……真的没问题吗……。  \n不，不过也只能上了！加油～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
